-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions of seat manufacturer from part P0 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P0-cases-seat-manufacturer: the cases of the questions in P0-seat-manufacturer.l4: the facts a person in the seat would state.
-- Every expected value was decided from the text of the Regulation before the file was run and is written beside its assertion with the words that license it;
-- none was copied from the encoding's output. A failing assertion is a finding, never an expectation to edit.
-- Dates the cases stand on: 31 July 2024 (the day before entry into force), 1 August 2024, 1 and 2 February 2025 (Chapter I), 26 and 27 July 2026 (each side of the Omnibus),
-- 1 and 2 August 2026 (the general date), 2 December 2026, 2 August 2027, 2 December 2027, 2 August 2028, 2 August 2030, 31 December 2030, as each function needs.
-- A MIRROR comment marks a case whose facts are asked, with the same answer, in the case file of another seat (the Guide, section 3).
-- A #TRACE is preceded by its -- EXPECT line (FULFILLED, BREACH or OPEN: the obligation still pending). The clock of a trace is the number of days since the day the rule counts from.
-- Assertions: 94. Traces: 6.

§ `Article 1: does Chapter I apply on the date asked?`

-- Under Article 1, as a product manufacturer, does Chapter I apply on the date asked
-- 1 January 2024, before the Regulation exists: JUST FALSE, the Regulation has not entered into force (Art 113, first paragraph: "on the twentieth day following that of its publication")
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a product manufacturer, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 1 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 31 July 2024, the day before entry into force: JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a product manufacturer, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 31 7 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 1 August 2024, in force but Chapter I applies only from 2 February 2025: JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a product manufacturer, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 1 February 2025, the day before Chapter I applies (Art 113(a)): JUST FALSE
-- MIRROR Art 113(a): whether Chapter I applies, asked from every seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a product manufacturer, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 2 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 2 February 2025, the day Chapter I applies (Art 113(a)): JUST TRUE
-- MIRROR Art 113(a): whether Chapter I applies, asked from every seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a product manufacturer, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 2 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, the text as enacted still in force: JUST TRUE (as enacted point (a): "Chapters I and II shall apply from 2 February 2025")
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a product manufacturer, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 26 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST TRUE (point (a) as replaced keeps 2 February 2025 for Chapters I and II)
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a product manufacturer, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE


§ `Article 2(1): does the Regulation apply to me?`

-- Under Article 2(1)(e), as a product manufacturer, does the Regulation apply to me
-- 1 February 2025, Chapter I has not begun to apply, so nothing is covered (Art 113(a): Chapters I and II "shall apply from 2 February 2025")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(e), as a product manufacturer, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025, together with the product and under its own name: JUST TRUE ("product manufacturers placing on the market or putting into service an AI system together with their product and under their own name or trademark")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(e), as a product manufacturer, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 2 February 2025, together with the product but not under its own name: NOTHING (limited by "under their own name or trademark")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(e), as a product manufacturer, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025, under its own name but not together with a product: NOTHING (limited by "together with their product")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(e), as a product manufacturer, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 2 2 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST TRUE (limb (e) was not changed)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(e), as a product manufacturer, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE


