#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a product manufacturer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 6 "" 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 60a: JUST TRUE ("Article 60a" is named as amended)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a product manufacturer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 60 "a" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 110: JUST TRUE (as amended the list runs to Article 112)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a product manufacturer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 110 "" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 113: JUST FALSE (outside "Articles 102 to 112")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a product manufacturer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 113 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 9: JUST FALSE (not named as amended)
-- MIRROR Art 2(2): the same Article asked from each operator seat about the same high-risk AI system
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a product manufacturer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 9 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 57, not integrated: JUST FALSE ("Articles 57, 58 and 59 shall apply only in so far as ... integrated")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a product manufacturer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 57 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 57, integrated: JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a product manufacturer, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 57 "" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 58, integrated: JUST TRUE (as amended Article 58 joins the conditional sentence)
