§ `Article 3(3) to (8): does the definition of my role fit me?`

-- Under Article 3(8), as a product manufacturer, am I an operator
-- the seat's role is passed as the keel's `Role`: TRUE ("'operator' means a provider, product manufacturer, deployer, authorised representative, importer or distributor"): the role of this seat is on the list
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(8), as a product manufacturer, am I an operator` EQUALS TRUE


§ `Article 3(14), (14a), (14b): safety component, SME, small mid-cap enterprise (the Omnibus replaced one and inserted two)`

-- Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component
-- 26 July 2026 (text as enacted), a component that fulfils a safety function: TRUE (as enacted: "which fulfils a safety function for that product or AI system, or the failure or malfunctioning of which endangers the health and safety")
-- MIRROR Art 3(14): the same component asked from the provider and manufacturer seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 27 July 2026 (text as amended), the same facts: FALSE (as amended a component fulfils a safety function "where its intended purpose is to prevent or mitigate risks", and here it neither has that purpose nor endangers anyone)
-- MIRROR Art 3(14): the same component asked from the provider and manufacturer seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, intended purpose to prevent risks but no safety function claimed: FALSE (as enacted the intended-purpose sentence is not in the text)
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, intended purpose to prevent risks: TRUE ("a component fulfils a safety function where its intended purpose is to prevent or mitigate risks")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, failure would endanger health and safety: TRUE ("or the failure or malfunctioning of which endangers the health and safety of persons or property")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, failure would endanger health and safety: TRUE (the same limb in both texts)
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, not a component of a product or of an AI system: FALSE ("a component of a product or of an AI system")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component` (Date 26 7 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, not a component of a product or of an AI system: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14), as a product manufacturer, is my component a safety component` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE


§ `Article 111(1): components of large-scale IT systems listed in Annex X`

-- Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation
-- 31 July 2024, before entry into force: NOTHING (the Regulation did not exist)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 31 7 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS NOTHING
-- 1 August 2024, the day the Regulation enters into force, an Annex X component placed in 2020: JUST 31 December 2030 ("shall be brought into compliance with this Regulation by 31 December 2030")
-- MIRROR Art 111(1): the date for the same Annex X component, asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 1 August 2027, the day before the placement bound: placed before 2 August 2027, so JUST 31 December 2030 ("placed on the market or put into service before 2 August 2027")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1861" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 2 August 2027, the placement bound itself: NOTHING (not "before 2 August 2027")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 2 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1861" EQUALS NOTHING
-- not a component of a large-scale IT system: NOTHING (the rule reaches components of the systems listed in Annex X)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE "none" EQUALS NOTHING
-- a component of a large-scale IT system established by an act that Annex X does not list: NOTHING ("the legal acts listed in Annex X")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" EQUALS NOTHING
-- Annex X point 1(c), Regulation (EU) 2018/1862: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1862" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- Annex X point 7(b), the last act of the Annex, Regulation (EU) 2019/818: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2019/818" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 26 July 2026, the text as enacted: JUST 31 December 2030 (paragraph 1 was not changed by the Omnibus)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 2 August 2026, the day the group General (which holds Article 111 itself) begins to apply: JUST 31 December 2030 (the date the paragraph gives does not move on that day)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)

-- Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked
-- an Annex X component placed in 2020: the operator brings it into compliance on day 2343 (31 December 2030, counted from 1 August 2024): discharged
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 111(1) bring the AI system into compliance with this Regulation` AT 2343
-- the same, one day late (day 2344, 1 January 2031): BREACH
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 111(1) bring the AI system into compliance with this Regulation` AT 2344
-- the same, the operator does nothing and time passes beyond 31 December 2030: BREACH
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2344
-- not a component of a large-scale IT system: nothing is owed, so a long wait is not a breach
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE "none" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2443
-- placed on 2 August 2027, the placement bound: nothing is owed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 2 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2443
-- 31 July 2024, before the Regulation exists: nothing is owed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a product manufacturer, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 31 7 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2443


§ `Article 111(2), first sentence: is my high-risk AI system saved? (replaced by the Omnibus)`

-- Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation
-- 26 July 2026 (text as enacted), Annex III route, placed 1 August 2026, not changed: TRUE ("placed on the market or put into service before 2 August 2026, only if, as from that date, those systems are subject to significant changes in their designs")
-- MIRROR Art 111(2) first sentence: the same legacy high-risk AI system asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, placed on 2 August 2026, the date itself: FALSE (not "before 2 August 2026")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, placed 1 August 2026 and significantly changed in its design since: FALSE (the "only if" is met, so the Regulation applies)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, not a high-risk AI system: FALSE ("operators of high-risk AI systems")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 7 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026 (text as amended), Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027, not changed: TRUE ("before the date of application of Chapter III referred to in Article 113": 2 December 2027 for an Annex III system)
-- MIRROR Art 111(2) first sentence: the same legacy high-risk AI system asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex III route, placed 2 December 2027: FALSE (not before 2 December 2027)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex I route, placed 2 August 2028: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027 and significantly changed: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, not a high-risk AI system: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 2 August 2026, the general date, Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027, not changed: TRUE (as amended; the saving does not stop on the day the group General begins)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a product manufacturer, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS TRUE


